{"id":"5f78118711a12b83","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-T-schema-limits.md","title":"经典自指全T-schema导致不一致","display":"lem-T-schema-limits — 经典自指全T-schema导致不一致","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-T-schema-limits","aliases":["91-lem-T-schema-limits","91-lem-T-schema-restriction","91-lem-disquotation-limits"],"display":"lem-T-schema-limits — 经典自指全T-schema导致不一致","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-T-schema-limits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-T-schema-limits</span><span>91-lem-T-schema-restriction</span><span>91-lem-disquotation-limits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-T-schema-limits — 经典自指全T-schema导致不一致"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" href=\"?note=41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" title=\"91-thm-diagonal-lemma\">91-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-T-schema-limits-—-经典自指全-T-schema-导致不一致\">lem-T-schema-limits — 经典自指全 T-schema 导致不一致</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> (采用经典逻辑并能实施对角化的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 自身语言编码的真理谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> (满足说谎者对角式的句子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> (固定矛盾句)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\bot\">\\(\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\bot\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}limits}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\lambda\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}limits}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\lambda\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因而在这些前提下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把两个双条件合成得到\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>，\n经典逻辑随即推出矛盾。危险组合是\n自指语言、说谎者对角化、经典逻辑与该句的透明 T-schema 同时成立。</p>\n<p>TB、UTB 和分层真理通过限制实例语言避免该组合；KF 用强 Kleene\n组合条件刻画自指真理，而不是断言所有自指句的经典透明双条件。标准\nFS 仍采用经典外层逻辑，但使用组合公理和 capture/release 规则；它\n并未加入不受限制的自指全 T-schema。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-T-schema-limits-—-经典自指全-T-schema-导致不一致","text":"lem-T-schema-limits — 经典自指全 T-schema 导致不一致","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}limits}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\lambda\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\bot,","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":1715,"backlinks":[{"id":"567189f4b7e57f6f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"应用展开的对角性质于 $\\theta(x)=\\neg T(x)$，再将全语言透明性\n实例化于所得 $\\lambda$，便满足 [[91-lem-T-schema-limits]] 的两个前提。\nPA 及自然句法表示保证这里的对角性质；一般理论则明确以它为条件，\n故没有把所有经典一阶理论一律判为不一致。"},{"id":"f626099313d4c0b8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-T-schema-limits]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-T-schema-limits]]"}],"outgoing":["ba367ff1b4bb3da3","cac035693aea2791","41fdad0bfaff0bf5"]}